# Run outputs are committed on purpose: an evidence directory is the reviewable record of what
# an automation actually did, and it is only safe to commit because everything written there
# goes through src/evidence.py's redact() -- balances and identifiers are masked at the
# persistence boundary, and the masking is lossy and one-way. Secrets live in .env, which stays
# ignored below; nothing reads a key into an event or a summary.

# OS
.DS_Store
